[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m ### Step 1: Define variables
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m Let:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m - $ s $ be her walking speed (in km/h)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m - $ t $ be the time spent in the coffee shop (in minutes)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m - She walks **9 km** at speed $ s $, and the **total time** is 4 hours.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m - So the **walking time** is $ 4 - \frac{t}{60} $ hours.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m \text{Walking time at speed } s = \frac{9}{s} \text{ hours}
