[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m ### Step 3: Solve system of equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m From Equation 1:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60} \quad \Rightarrow \quad \frac{t}{60} = 4 - \frac{9}{s}
