[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m Check $ a=3, b=1 $: $ 27 \times 7 = 189 $ → ends with 9 ❌  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=9368)[0m Check $ a=4, b=1 $: $ 81 \times 7 = 567 $ → ends with 7 ❌
